    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jiggle Ball is an active ragdoll, physics based game for you and your friends. Play goofy sports and jiggle your way to victory in hilariously ridiculous ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With These silly, slapstick characters and stupendously chaotic play spaces. You can be sure to find yourselves in all sorts of mischief and trouble.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome Jigglers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to jiggle your way into the chaotically fun world of Jiggle Ball? Get ready to punch, jump, grab and jiggle your way through an Intense team-based showdown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every gaming session can be tailored to your play style with a fully customizable pitch. Want more chaos? Add obstacles! Want a more relaxed session? Keep only your favourites!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is all about simplifying sorts and putting chaos in the centre of it all!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >up to 4 player split-screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team based</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customisable maps, levels to suit your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 unique obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jiggle Jiggle!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>About the devs!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, we are Playing With Wires, a group of three students working on this game a passion project alongside our studies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a passion for games, learning and most importantly fun, We are welcoming everyone to join our socials and reach out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to join our discord, message us on Instagram or just send us an email. :)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jiggle Ball is an active ragdoll, physics based game for you and your friends. Play goofy sports and jiggle your way to victory in hilariously ridiculous ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With These silly, slapstick characters and stupendously chaotic play spaces. You can be sure to find yourselves in all sorts of mischief and trouble.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome Jigglers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to jiggle your way into the chaotically fun world of Jiggle Ball? Get ready to punch, jump, grab and jiggle your way through an Intense team-based showdown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every gaming session can be tailored to your play style with a fully customizable pitch. Want more chaos? Add obstacles! Want a more relaxed session? Keep only your favourites!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is all about simplifying sorts and putting chaos in the centre of it all!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >up to 4 player split-screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team based</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customisable maps, levels to suit your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 unique obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jiggle Jiggle!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>About the devs!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, we are Playing With Wires, a group of three students working on this game a passion project alongside our studies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a passion for games, learning and most importantly fun, We are welcoming everyone to join our socials and reach out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to join our discord, message us on Instagram or just send us an email. :)</p>",
